<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Produit cr&eacute;&eacute;</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #e8eaed;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .email-container {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(60,64,67,0.3), 0 1px 3px 1px rgba(60,64,67,0.15);
    }

    .header { padding: 28px 32px 20px; text-align: center; }
    .header-info { background-color: #1a73e8; }
    .header-success { background-color: #1e8e3e; }
    .header-warning { background-color: #f9ab00; }
    .header-error { background-color: #d93025; }

    .header h1 { color: #ffffff; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.2px; line-height: 1.3; }
    .header p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 4px; }

    .content { padding: 28px 32px 20px; }

    .greeting { font-size: 14px; color: #202124; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .message { font-size: 14px; color: #5f6368; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px; }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; color: #80868b; text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .details-card { background: #f8f9fa; border: 1px solid #dadce0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0 16px; }

    .detail-row {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 10px 0;
      font-size: 14px; color: #5f6368; border-bottom: 1px solid #e8eaed;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .label { color: #5f6368; }
    .value { color: #202124; font-weight: 500; text-align: right; }

    .status-box {
      padding: 14px 16px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .status-box strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
    .status-info { background: #e8f0fe; color: #174ea6; }
    .status-success { background: #e6f4ea; color: #1e7e34; }
    .status-warning { background: #fef7e0; color: #5f4b00; }
    .status-error { background: #fce8e6; color: #a50e0e; }

    .button-container { text-align: center; margin: 24px 0; }

    .button {
      display: inline-block; background: #1a73e8; color: #ffffff;
      padding: 10px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px;
    }
    .button:hover { background: #1557b0; }

    .support {
      text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #5f6368;
      line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e8eaed;
    }
    .support a { color: #1a73e8; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }

    .footer {
      padding: 16px 32px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px;
      color: #80868b; line-height: 1.8; background: #f8f9fa;
      border-top: 1px solid #dadce0;
    }
    .footer a { color: #5f6368; text-decoration: none; }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .header { padding: 24px 20px 16px; }
      .header h1 { font-size: 18px; }
      .content { padding: 24px 20px 16px; }
      .footer { padding: 16px 20px; }
    }
    /* Presentation only: a warmer, more human visual language. */
    body { background: #f5f1eb; padding: 28px 16px; color: #263238; }
    .email-container { max-width: 600px; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(48,40,32,.14); }
    .header { padding: 34px 36px 28px; } .header-info { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#2169a8,#3d8dcc); } .header-success { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#237a57,#4aa77c); } .header-warning { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#bb6b17,#e19b38); } .header-error { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#b84242,#df6860); }
    .header h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.45px; } .header p { font-size: 14px; margin-top: 7px; } .content { padding: 34px 36px 28px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 14px; } .message { color: #5d6669; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 26px; } .section-title { color: #8a735b; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.1px; margin-top: 28px; }
    .details-card, .info-card, .next-steps, .approver-card { background: #faf8f5; border-color: #ebe2d8; border-radius: 12px; } .detail-row, .info-row { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom-color: #ebe2d8; } .value, .info-label { color: #263238; font-weight: 700; }
    .status-box { border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin: 24px 0; line-height: 1.65; } .status-box strong { font-weight: 700; } .status-info { background: #eaf4fb; color: #245a82; } .status-success { background: #eaf6ef; color: #246345; } .status-warning { background: #fff5e5; color: #865214; } .status-error { background: #fcebea; color: #923b36; }
    .reason-text { border-left-color: #cf5b52; border-radius: 8px; background: #fff9f8; } .button-container { margin: 28px 0; } .button { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#2169a8,#3d8dcc); border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(33,105,168,.24); padding: 13px 28px; font-weight: 700; }
    .support { border-top-color: #ebe2d8; color: #697477; margin-top: 26px; } .support a { color: #2169a8; } .footer { padding: 20px 36px; background: #faf8f5; border-top-color: #ebe2d8; color: #7c8586; } .footer a { color: #53666b; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { body { padding: 12px; } .email-container { border-radius: 14px; } .header { padding: 28px 22px 22px; } .content { padding: 28px 22px 22px; } .footer { padding: 18px 22px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-container">
    <div class="header header-warning">
      <h1>Produit cr&eacute;&eacute;</h1>
      <p>En attente de validation</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p class="message">Bonjour {{userName}},<br><br>Votre produit <strong>{{productName}}</strong> a &eacute;t&eacute; cr&eacute;&eacute; avec succ&egrave;s dans le syst&egrave;me <strong>{{appName}}</strong>.</p>

      <div class="status-box status-warning">
        <strong>Statut : En attente de validation</strong>
        Votre produit a &eacute;t&eacute; enregistr&eacute; dans notre syst&egrave;me et est actuellement en attente de validation par nos administrateurs. Vous serez notifi&eacute; d&egrave;s qu'il aura &eacute;t&eacute; valid&eacute;.
      </div>

      <p class="message">Si vous avez des questions ou besoin d'assistance, n'h&eacute;sitez pas &agrave; nous contacter.</p>

      <div class="support">
        <strong>Besoin d'aide ?</strong><br />
        <a href="{{supportLink}}">Assistance</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; 2026 {{appName}}. Tous droits r&eacute;serv&eacute;s.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
